<title>GREECE: GREEK 1M ATHIBOR EASES TO 11.91 FROM 11.97 PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK 1M ATHIBOR EASES TO 11.91 FROM 11.97 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate</p>
<p>(Athibor) eased to 11.91 from 11.97 percent and the bid rate</p>
<p>(Athibid) for one month slipped to 11.40 from 11.45 percent.</p>
<p>ATHIBOR</p>
<p> DATE     1-MTH   2-MTH   3-MTH   6-MTH   9-MTH   12-MTH</p>
<p> Aug  11  11.91   11.51   11.41   11.27   11.18   11.10</p>
<p> Aug  08  11.97   11.62   11.56   11.27   11.21   11.11</p>
<p> Aug  07  12.08   11.78   11.65   11.31   11.23   11.13</p>
<p> Aug  06  12.13   12.03   11.74   11.42   11.25   11.17</p>
<p> Aug  05  11.84   11.53   11.41   11.26   11.14   11.04</p>
<p> Aug  04  11.63   11.34   11.21   11.04   10.94   10.91</p>
<p> Aug  01  11.53   11.25   11.20   11.04   11.00   11.00</p>
<p> July 31  11.53   11.22   11.14   11.02   10.96   10.97</p>
<p>ATHIBID</p>
<p> Aug  11  11.40   11.01   10.91   10.75   10.65   10.58</p>
<p> Aug  08  11.45   11.09   11.04   10.76   10.68   10.59</p>
<p> Aug  07  11.56   11.25   11.13   10.79   10.69   10.60</p>
<p> Aug  06  11.61   11.50   11.21   10.89   10.70   10.60</p>
<p> Aug  05  11.34   11.02   10.90   10.75   10.60   10.52</p>
<p> Aug  04  11.13   10.83   10.71   10.54   10.45   10.40</p>
<p> Aug  01  11.02   10.75   10.70   10.54   10.50   10.50</p>
<p> July 31  11.02   10.72   10.64   10.52   10.46   10.46</p>
<p>Note: ATHIBOR is Greece's official reference rate. It</p>
<p>comprises 18 leading state and private banks committed to</p>
<p>quoting their rates by 0900 GMT every day.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
